  "prefLabel": "Res 5303.03 Written Contract",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 5303.03 Written Contract. A written contract pursuant to RSA 227-J:15, III shall be provided by the landowner and/or the seller or buyer of timber for review upon request of the director or the director’s authorized agent.\n\nSource. #8441, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10547, eff 3-21-14",
